{"id":"5a3580720b15e8eb","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-prob2-independence-family.md","title":"ZFC Prob2 Independence Family","display":"df-zfc-prob2-independence-family — ZFC Prob2 Independence Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob2-independence-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob2-independence-family"],"display":"df-zfc-prob2-independence-family — ZFC Prob2 Independence Family","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob2-independence-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob2-independence-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob2-independence-family — ZFC Prob2 Independence Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span> (indexed event-family)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (index set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathbb P\\)</span> (probability measure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\((\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (probability space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S\\)</span> (probability-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (three-place function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2IndependenceFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2IndependenceFamily}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}independence\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb2IndependenceFamily}_S(\\mathcal A,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal A,I,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal F))\\land\\forall J\\in[I]^{&lt;\\omega}\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\;\\forall A\\in\\prod_{j\\in J}\\mathcal A(j)\\;(\\mathbb P(\\bigcap_{j\\in J}A(j))=\\prod_{j\\in J}\\mathbb P(A(j)))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}independence\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb2IndependenceFamily}_S(\\mathcal A,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal A,I,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal F))\\land\\forall J\\in[I]^{&lt;\\omega}\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\;\\forall A\\in\\prod_{j\\in J}\\mathcal A(j)\\;(\\mathbb P(\\bigcap_{j\\in J}A(j))=\\prod_{j\\in J}\\mathbb P(A(j)))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The indexed family is required to be a genuine function; knowing only its domain would still allow a multivalued relation while the assertion uses <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A(i)\">\\(\\mathcal A(i)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"d4d304b0bbb11c1a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"d4d304b0bbb11c1a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb P$ (probability measure, see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"d4d304b0bbb1